<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sanmina raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sanmina raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for Sanmina Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Jose, Calif., maker of electronic products closed on Monday at 46.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
